; M2-BPR-07: the Ch2 tideline below Haluna at dawn, the first battle (greybox; env-art builds tideline_dawn).
; Grade from docs/kb/art/color_script.md "Ch2": 06:20, sun 6 deg over the eastern sea, key #FFB87B 2.4, fill
; #7FA6CC 0.5, sky #4E7FB8 / #F6C9A0, fog #E9C9A8, exposure 0.75. BattleArena: WorldEnvironment and Sun replace the
; battle scene's, every other child goes under its new Arena node (Sea becomes Arena/Sea). Dry sand behind the
; party, a dark wet band and rocks, then the lagoon behind the foes.

